 {"feature":"stylometry","claim":"A reader commenting on Trammell's essay attributes Oriental Adventures' authorship to David Cook on the evidence of its diction and style.","source":"Commenter on Aaron Trammell, Analog Game Studies, comment thread","url":"https://analoggamestudies.org/2016/01/how-dungeons-dragons-appropriated-the-orient/","quote":"Judging from the diction and style of the writing","page":"comments","kind":"reader","polarity":"asserts","date":"2016 or later","routeHint":"direct curl, browser UA","registerHint":"none","confidence":"low: an unverified reader comment, offered here only as evidence that readers hear an author-specific house voice"},
